{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C9Cjzq7qdToZ3tEVAP8NNJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: ms/schemas/task\\nchecksum: 95f8bdb8a70a04e0102bc57d8c1308eb596764f2ce74d1fb4cef8348cb29d780\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='ms')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='ms')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6b2a97c-b7b5-4fd4-8757-b92f993bd6ae","uuid":"f2df4e02-c386-4f0e-ba49-73a014b99956","timestamp":"2026-11-03T10:15:54.954Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: ms/schemas/task\\nchecksum: 95f8bdb8a70a04e0102bc57d8c1308eb596764f2ce74d1fb4cef8348cb29d780\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='ms')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='ms')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Basic Memory","version":"4.1.3"},"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"Created schemas/Task.md\ntitle: Task\npermalink: ms/schemas/task\nchecksum: 95f8bdb8a70a04e0102bc57d8c1308eb596764